SecLLM is a control plane and console for vLLM (https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm),
the third-party inference engine it manages. vLLM is distributed under its own license and
is not included in this repository; it is installed on a GPU host at deploy time. Model
weights are likewise not distributed here — they are downloaded under their own licenses.
